{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22314","headline":"寄江南兄弟 · 白居易","name":"寄江南兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分散骨肉恋，趋驰名利牵。\n一奔尘埃马，一泛风波船。\n忽忆分手时，悯默秋风前。\n别来朝复夕，积日成七年。\n花落城中池，春深江上天。\n登楼东南望，鸟灭烟苍然。\n相去复几许，道里近三千。\n平地犹难见，况乃隔山川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}